    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The mechanical golem that the Black Anvil Guild is desperately looking for. It is the most advanced golem design. It animated and ran amok because the artisan accidentally installed a defective component. It partially destroyed the workshop, crushed many Dwarven Artisans who tried to restrain it, and escaped the town. It wanders the woods aimlessly, and attacks any who come nearby. Magic Creatures Lv. 2 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Magic Creatures. P. Def. +5% Max HP +3% Received Critical Damage -10% Received M. Crit. Damage -10% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% Speed -5 Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
